flowchart TB
    subgraph P1[准备]
        direction LR
        REQ[请求] --> CHECK[参数校验] --> TPL[取模板] --> MUSIC[取音乐元数据]
    end
    subgraph P2[决策]
        direction LR
        STYLE[决定剪辑风格] --> CUT{片段选择}
        CUT -->|AI 高光| FIX[校正与剔除]
        CUT -->|无 AI| EVEN[等分兜底]
    end
    subgraph P3[编排]
        direction LR
        TL[构建时间轴] --> TRANS[填转场] --> DECOR[叠加装饰] --> SPEED[变速] --> ALIGN[音乐对齐]
    end
    P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> OUT[输出工程描述]
    style P1 fill:#16161a,stroke:#2a2a30,color:#8b8b94
